############################################

### Asociar Lino al producto 7 - DEFAULT
POST {{Calubridi_Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/7/fabrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fabricId": 1,
  "price": 45000,
  "isDefault": true,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Asociar Seda al producto 7
POST {{Calubridi_Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/7/fabrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fabricId": 2,
  "price": 52000,
  "isDefault": false,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Asociar Crepé al producto 7
POST {{Calubridi_Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/7/fabrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fabricId": 5,
  "price": 48000,
  "isDefault": false,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Obtener telas disponibles del producto 7
GET {{Calubridi_Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/7/fabrics
Accept: application/json





